{"src":"en","tgt":"de","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":189600,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"de","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"commercial","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":9638.997289,"text":"In 1990, it was added to the list of World Heritage Sites in Danger due to the threat of desert sands."},{"kind":"text","t":10124.941211000001,"text":"1990 wurde es aufgrund der Bedrohung durch Wüstensande in die Liste der gefährdeten Welterbestätten aufgenommen."},{"kind":"audio","t":10370.856595000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10375.38156,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10380.424368,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10385.606054,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10390.81259,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":10396.269502000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10401.525327000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10404.507545,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10407.66987,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10408.756924000001,"samples":13820,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":570},{"kind":"input","t":18854.805222,"text":"If you have watched the movie National Treasure, you may think a treasure map was written on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"text","t":19384.682397,"text":"Wenn Sie den Film National Treasure gesehen haben, glauben Sie vielleicht, dass auf der Rückseite der Unabhängigkeitserklärung eine Schatzkarte geschrieben stand."},{"kind":"audio","t":19602.453173,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19605.628077,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19608.591215,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19609.732939,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19611.265327,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19612.960703,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19614.639129,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19616.320835,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19618.207068,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19618.77788,"samples":13263,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":550},{"kind":"input","t":26843.554441,"text":"Children are placed in foster care for a wide variety of reasons that range from neglect to abuse."},{"kind":"text","t":27290.242862,"text":"Kinder kommen aus einer Vielzahl von Gründen in Pflegefamilien, die von Vernachlässigung bis hin zu Missbrauch reichen."},{"kind":"audio","t":27458.126338000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27459.459179,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27461.393631,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27463.272725,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27465.235697,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27467.173359,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27469.143081000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27470.537901,"samples":27250,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1130},{"kind":"input","t":29890.422599,"text":"and even to extortion."},{"kind":"text","t":30086.580332,"text":"und sogar bis hin zu Erpressung."},{"kind":"audio","t":30143.388872,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":30145.162957,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":30145.439813,"samples":6074,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":250},{"kind":"input","t":40799.423130999996,"text":"Chocamo Valley, Chile's premier climbing destination, known as the Yosemite of South America, with a variety of granite big walls and crags."},{"kind":"text","t":41483.126142999994,"text":"Das Chocamo-Tal, Chiles bedeutendstes Klettergebiet, bekannt als das Yosemite Südamerikas, mit einer Vielzahl an Granit-Big-Walls und Felsklettern."},{"kind":"audio","t":41721.590693,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41725.747103999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41729.022947,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41732.32874,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41735.700340999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41739.024514,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41741.684865999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41743.248953999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41744.93631,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41745.366974,"samples":12705,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":520},{"kind":"input","t":46518.155673999994,"text":"Accepted were Aristotle's views on all matters of science, including physiology."},{"kind":"text","t":46904.18735,"text":"Aristoteles' Ansichten zu allen wissenschaftlichen Fragen, einschließlich der Physiologie, wurden akzeptiert."},{"kind":"audio","t":47070.860043999994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":47076.95340699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":47083.897138,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":47090.07803,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":47094.430018,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":47098.706226999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":47103.339291,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":47105.397822,"samples":18334,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":760},{"kind":"input","t":54290.079503999994,"text":"If you're not used to driving on country roads, keep your wits about you. Steep grades, narrow lanes, and sharp curves predominate."},{"kind":"text","t":54668.037345,"text":"Wenn Sie es nicht gewohnt sind, auf Landstraßen zu fahren, bleiben Sie wachsam. Steile Steigungen, schmale Gassen und scharfe Kurven überwiegen."},{"kind":"audio","t":54832.400881999994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54837.320772,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54842.617256,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54847.874461,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54853.366183,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54858.053356,"samples":30371,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1260},{"kind":"audio","t":54862.892787,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54866.11318099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54869.417583999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54872.734907,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54875.437097999995,"samples":27752,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1150},{"kind":"input","t":67492.069573,"text":"The presence of the true invisible team, Larson and LaFasto, 1989, page 109, is also a unique component of a virtual team."},{"kind":"text","t":68199.9826,"text":"Die Präsenz des wahren unsichtbaren Teams, Larson und LaFasto, 1989, Seite 109, ist ebenfalls eine einzigartige Komponente eines virtuellen Teams."},{"kind":"audio","t":68487.930694,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68489.186336,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68490.46235799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68492.023856,"samples":32768,"rat