,"text":"Viele deutsche Backwaren enthalten Mandeln, Haselnüsse und andere Schalenfrüchte. Beliebte Kuchen passen oft besonders gut zu einer Tasse starkem Kaffee."},{"kind":"audio","t":83341.46732699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83346.56337399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83351.88124799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83357.08809399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83361.480981,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83364.34692,"samples":27027,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1120},{"kind":"audio","t":83367.580424,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83370.818388,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83374.108971,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83377.279106,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83378.831494,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83379.224548,"samples":14489,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":600},{"kind":"input","t":90150.980088,"text":"Needless to say, if you know a Romance language, it will be easier for you to learn Portuguese."},{"kind":"text","t":90697.296059,"text":"Es versteht sich von selbst, dass es für Sie einfacher sein wird, Portugiesisch zu lernen, wenn Sie eine romanische Sprache beherrschen."},{"kind":"audio","t":90921.881737,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90926.958614,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90932.17713,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90937.486544,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90942.526332,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90947.846096,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90952.155765,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90955.507017,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90958.82858,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90959.754497,"samples":11312,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":470},{"kind":"input","t":97837.118621,"text":"The pyramid sound and light show is one of the most interesting things in the area for kids."},{"kind":"text","t":98305.01223,"text":"Die Ton- und Lichtshow an den Pyramiden ist für Kinder eine der interessantesten Attraktionen in der Gegend."},{"kind":"audio","t":98462.22727799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98467.26407599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98472.541751,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98477.61570899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98483.014132,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98488.30499599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98493.501872,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98494.049744,"samples":8860,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":360},{"kind":"input","t":103731.208354,"text":"Traffic flow is the study of the movement of individual drivers and vehicles between two points."},{"kind":"text","t":104053.43811,"text":"Der Verkehrsfluss ist die Untersuchung der Bewegung einzelner Fahrer und Fahrzeuge zwischen zwei Punkten."},{"kind":"audio","t":104211.92826,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104215.537149,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104219.791398,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104223.84168,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104226.092618,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104228.10023,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104229.998952,"samples":32712,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"input","t":106589.97912399999,"text":"and the interactions they make with one another."},{"kind":"text","t":106831.49290099999,"text":"und die Wechselwirkungen, die sie untereinander eingehen."},{"kind":"audio","t":106943.08278,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106947.32301,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106950.20397799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106953.374233,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106953.74670799999,"samples":5182,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":210},{"kind":"input","t":114644.240899,"text":"Australia's Mitchell Gowrie finished 11th in the men's standing Super G Chet's"},{"kind":"text","t":115009.02748799999,"text":"Australiens Mitchell Gowrie belegte im Super-G der Männer den 11. Platz."},{"kind":"audio","t":115145.939015,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115150.600589,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115155.778305,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115160.812263,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115166.11714799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115166.429623,"samples":835,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":30},{"kind":"audio","t":115171.55277,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115172.488367,"samples":8749,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":360},{"kind":"input","t":121636.60204299999,"text":"competitor Ulrich Joklin finished 16th in the men's sitting Super G."},{"kind":"text","t":122081.802035,"text":"Der Teilnehmer Ulrich Joklin belegte im Super-G der Männer in der Kategorie Sitzen den 16. Platz."},{"kind":"audio","t":122241.108474,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122246.251681,"samples":3