"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137134.30324,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137139.536915,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137144.713742,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137149.907378,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137154.490452,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137157.849074,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137158.574234,"samples":11758,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":480},{"kind":"input","t":145661.348053,"text":"It also attacked anything that entered the water. Even a giant dinosaur such as T-Rex would be no match for it."},{"kind":"text","t":146016.112375,"text":"Es griff zudem alles an, was ins Wasser gelangte. Selbst ein riesiger Dinosaurier wie der T-Rex wäre ihm nicht gewachsen."},{"kind":"audio","t":146132.340478,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146137.186419,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146142.573312,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146143.942493,"samples":11758,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":480},{"kind":"audio","t":146157.4522,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146162.33817,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146167.451498,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146172.727472,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146177.610243,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146177.858559,"samples":4179,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":170},{"kind":"input","t":155045.576855,"text":"The use of video recording has led to important discoveries in the interpretation of microexpressions."},{"kind":"text","t":155415.956424,"text":"Der Einsatz von Videoaufzeichnungen hat zu wichtigen Erkenntnissen bei de